{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 4x<sup>4</sup> + 16 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 2", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 2", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> - 2x - 2", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + 4x + 4", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>4</sup> + 16<br />= 4(x<sup>4</sup> + 4)<br />= 4{(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2<sup>2</sup>}<br />= 4{(x<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - 2.x<sup>2</sup>.2}<br />= 4{(x<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - (2x)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= 4[{(x<sup>2</sup> + 2) + 2x}{(x<sup>2</sup> +2) - 2x}]<br />= 4(x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 2)</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>6</sup> - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1", "option3": "গ) x - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>6</sup> - 1<br />= (x<sup>3</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>3</sup> + 1)(x<sup>3</sup> - 1)<br />= (x + 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)(x - 1)(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) a<sup>4</sup> + a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>4</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) a<sup>2</sup> + ab - b<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) ab + b<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup> - ab - b<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>a<sup>4</sup> + a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>4</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (b<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2.a<sup>2</sup>.b<sup>2</sup> - (ab)<sup>2</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - (ab)<sup>2</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + ab)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> - ab)</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x<sup>2</sup> - 1 - y(y - 2) এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + y + 1", "option2": "খ) x + y - 1", "option3": "গ) x - y - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x + 2x + 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 1 - y(y - 2)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 1 - y<sup>2</sup> + 2y<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y<sup>2</sup> - 2y + 1)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y - 1)<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + y - 1)(x - y + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x<sup>2</sup> + 7x - 8 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 1", "option2": "খ) x - 1", "option3": "গ) x - 8", "option4": "ঘ) x + 7", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 7x - 8<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + 8x - x - 8<br />= x(x + 8) - 1(x + 8)<br />= (x + 8)(x - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) -4a<sup>2</sup> + 25a - 6 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a + 6", "option2": "খ) 4a + 1", "option3": "গ) a - 6", "option4": "ঘ) 2a + 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>- 4a<sup>2</sup> + 25a - 6<br />= - (4a<sup>2</sup> - 25a + 6)<br />= - (4a<sup>2</sup> - 24a - a + 6)<br />= - {4a(a - 6) - 1(a - 6)}<br />= - (a - 6)(4a - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) x<sup>3</sup> - x - p এর একটি উৎপাদক (x - 2) হলে p = ?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) -5", "option3": "গ) 5", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু, x - 2, f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> - x - p এর একটি উৎপাদক<br />&there4; f(2) = 0<br />বা, 2<sup>3</sup> - 2 - p = 0<br />বা, 6 - p = 0<br />&there4; p = 6</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) x<sup>3</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup> - x + 2 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 2", "option2": "খ) 2x + 1", "option3": "গ) x - 2", "option4": "ঘ) 2x - 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup> - x + 2 এর ক্ষেত্রে,<br />f(2) = 0<br />&there4; (x - 2) উৎপাদক</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x<sup>3</sup> - ax<sup>2</sup> + 11x - a এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 1 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) -4", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x -1, f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> - ax<sup>2</sup> + 11x - a এর একটি উৎপাদক<br />&there4; f(1) = 0 <br />বা, 1<sup>3</sup> - a.1<sup>2</sup> + 11.1 - a = 0 <br />বা, -2a + 12 = 0 <br />&there4; a = 6</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x<sup>2</sup> - 2mx + (m + n)(m - n) একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + m + n", "option2": "খ) x - m + n", "option3": "গ) x + m - n", "option4": "ঘ) -x + m + n", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 2mx + (m + n)(m - n)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 2mx + m<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup><br />= (x - m)<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup><br />= (x - m + n)(x - m - n)<br /><br />আবার,<br />x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 2mx + (m + n)(m - n)<br />= x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 2mx + m<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- n<sup>2</sup><br />= m<sup>2</sup> - 2mx + x<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup><br />= (m - x)<sup>2 </sup>- n<sup>2</sup><br />= (m - x + n)(m - x - n)<br />= (-x + m + n)(m - x - n)<br /><br />সুতরাং, অপশন খ) ও ঘ) দুটোই সম্ভব। তাই বাতিল করা হয়েছে।</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) a<sup>4</sup> + a এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) a + 1", "option3": "গ) a - 1", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a<sup>4</sup> + a<br />=a(a<sup>3</sup> + 1)<br />= a(a + 1)(a<sup>2</sup> - a + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) x<sup>3</sup> + kx<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 9 এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 3 হলে k = ?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু, x - 3, f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> + kx<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 9 এর একটি উৎপাদক -</p><p>&there4; f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> + k.3<sup>2</sup> - 6.3 - 9<br />বা, 27 + 9K - 18 - 9 = 0<br />বা, 9k = 0<br />&there4; k = 0</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) 1 - x<sup>2</sup> + 2ax - a<sup>2</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) 1 + x + a", "option2": "খ) 1 + x - a", "option3": "গ) 1 - x - a", "option4": "ঘ) 1 + 2x + 2a", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>1 - x<sup>2</sup> + 2ax -a<sup>2</sup><br />= 1 - (x<sup>2</sup> - 2ax + a<sup>2</sup>)<br />= 1 - (x - a)<sup>2</sup><br />= (1 + x -a)(1 - x + a)</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) 4x<sup>2</sup> + 4xy - 2y - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) 2x - 1", "option2": "খ) 2x + 1", "option3": "গ) 2x - 2y + 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2x - 2y - 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>2</sup> + 4xy - 2y - 1<br />= (2x)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup> + 2y(2x - 1)<br />= (2x + 1)(2x - 1) + 2y(2x - 1)<br />= (2x - 1)(2x + 2y + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) x - 8, x<sup>2</sup> - ax - 48 এর একটি উৎপাদক হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x - 8, f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> - ax - 48 এর একটি উৎপাদক হলে<br />f(8) = 0<br />বা, 8<sup>2</sup> - a.8 - 48 = 0<br />বা, 16 - a.8 = 0<br />বা, a.8 = 16<br />&there4; a = 2</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) x এর কোন মানের জন্য x<sup>2</sup> - 10x + 16 এর মান সর্বনিম্ন হবে?", "option1": "ক) -5", "option2": "খ) -4", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 10x + 16<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 2x.5 + 5<sup>2</sup> - 9<br />= (x - 5)<sup>2</sup> - 9<br />&there4; x = 5 এর জন্য রাশির মান সর্বনিম্ন।<br />(কেননা, x = 5 হলে রাশিটির মান হয় -9)</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) x<sup>3</sup> - 21x - 20 = 0 এর একটি সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) -5", "option2": "খ) -4", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x = -4 হলে x<sup>3</sup> - 21x - 20 = 0 হবে।</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) a<sup>3</sup> - 4a<sup>2</sup> + 3a = 0 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) -3", "option3": "গ) -1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>a = 3 হলে, a<sup>3</sup> - 4a<sup>2</sup> + 3a = 0 হবে।<br />&there4; a = 3</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) a<sup>3</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> - 2 = 0 এর একটি সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a<sup>3</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> - 2<br />= (a<sup>3</sup> - 1) + (a<sup>2</sup> - 1)<br />= (a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1) + (a+1)(a - 1)<br />= (a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1 + a + 1)<br />= (a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 2)<br />= (a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 2)<br />&there4; a = 1 হলে,<br />a<sup>3</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> - 2 = 0<br />&there4; a = 1</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) 3x - 5, ax<sup>2</sup> - x -